[{"id":"smq-year2-2.57-q1","number":1,"question":"<p>The points <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"B\" data-display=\"false\"></span> have position vectors of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\binom{-2}4\" data-display=\"false\"></span> metres and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\binom8{11}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> metres respectively. Find the distance between <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"B\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","steps":["<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\overrightarrow{AB}=\\binom8{11}-\\binom{-2}4=\\binom{10}7\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"|\\overrightarrow{AB}|=\\sqrt{10^2+7^2}=\\sqrt{149}\\text{ m}=12.2\" data-display=\"false\"></span> m (3 SF)</p>"]},{"id":"smq-year2-2.57-q2","number":2,"question":"<p>Given that a particle travels at the constant velocity given, find the speed of the particle:</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(-2\\mathbf i+4\\mathbf j)\\text{ ms}^{-1}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\binom58\\text{ ms}^{-1}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(2.5k\\mathbf i-6k\\mathbf j)\\text{ ms}^{-1}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, where <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k&gt;0\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\sqrt{2^2+4^2}=2\\sqrt5=4.47\\text{ ms}^{-1}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> (3 SF)</p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\sqrt{5^2+8^2}=\\sqrt{89}=9.43\\text{ ms}^{-1}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> (3 SF)</p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">c)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\sqrt{(2.5k)^2+(6k)^2}=6.5k\\text{ ms}^{-1}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> (3 SF)</p>"]},{"id":"smq-year2-2.57-q3","number":3,"question":"<p>A particle travels with a constant acceleration of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(-2\\mathbf i+3\\mathbf j)\\text{ ms}^{-2}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> from point <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A\" data-display=\"false\"></span> to point <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"B\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Its total displacement is <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(-400\\mathbf i+250\\mathbf j)\" data-display=\"false\"></span> m. Its final velocity is <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(12\\mathbf i+10\\mathbf j)\\text{ ms}^{-1}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Find</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p>the magnitude of the acceleration of the particle.</p></li><li><p>the distance from <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A\" data-display=\"false\"></span> to <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"B\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p></li><li><p>the speed of the particle when it passes through <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"B\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf a=-2\\mathbf i+3\\mathbf j\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\sqrt{2^2+3^2}=\\sqrt{13}=3.61\\text{ ms}^{-2}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> (3 SF)</p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf s=-400\\mathbf i+250\\mathbf j\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\sqrt{400^2+250^2}=50\\sqrt{89}=472\" data-display=\"false\"></span> m (3 SF)</p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">c)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf v=12\\mathbf i+10\\mathbf j\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\sqrt{12^2+10^2}=2\\sqrt{61}=15.6\\text{ ms}^{-1}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>"]},{"id":"smq-year2-2.57-q4","number":4,"question":"<p>A particle moves with constant acceleration <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(4\\mathbf i+7\\mathbf j)\\text{ ms}^{-2}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, and initially has velocity <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(\\mathbf i+2\\mathbf j)\\text{ ms}^{-1}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p><p>Find the velocity of the particle at <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"t=3\" data-display=\"false\"></span> seconds.</p>","steps":["<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf a=4\\mathbf i+7\\mathbf j,\\mathbf u=\\mathbf i+2\\mathbf j,t=3\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf v=\\mathbf u+\\mathbf at\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf v=(\\mathbf i+2\\mathbf j)+(4\\mathbf i+7\\mathbf j)\\times3=(13\\mathbf i+23\\mathbf j)\\text{ ms}^{-1}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>"]},{"id":"smq-year2-2.57-q5","number":5,"question":"<p>A particle moves with constant acceleration <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(-\\mathbf i+3\\mathbf j)\\text{ ms}^{-2}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. It has velocity <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(-2\\mathbf i+5\\mathbf j)\\text{ ms}^{-1}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> at <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"t=7\" data-display=\"false\"></span> seconds. Find</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p>the initial velocity of the particle.</p></li><li><p>the initial speed of the particle.</p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf a=-\\mathbf i+3\\mathbf j,\\mathbf v=-2\\mathbf i+5\\mathbf j,t=7\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf v=\\mathbf u+\\mathbf at\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(-2\\mathbf i+5\\mathbf j)=\\mathbf u+(-\\mathbf i+3\\mathbf j)\\times7\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf u=(5\\mathbf i-16\\mathbf j)\\text{ ms}^{-1}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\sqrt{5^2+16^2}=\\sqrt{281}=16.8\\text{ ms}^{-2}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> (3 SF)</p>"]},{"id":"smq-year2-2.57-q6","number":6,"question":"<p>An object is moving with constant acceleration. Initially it has velocity <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\binom43\\text{ ms}^{-1}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and 7 seconds later it has velocity <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\binom8{18}\\text{ ms}^{-1}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p><p>Find the magnitude of its acceleration.</p>","steps":["<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf u=\\binom43,t=7,\\mathbf v=\\binom8{18}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf v=\\mathbf u+\\mathbf at\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\binom8{18}=\\binom43+7\\mathbf a\" data-display=\"false\"></span> so <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf a=\\binom{\\frac47}{\\frac{15}7}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a=\\sqrt{\\left(\\frac47\\right)^2+\\left(\\frac{15}7\\right)^2}=2.22\\text{ ms}^{-2}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> (3 SF)</p>"]},{"id":"smq-year2-2.57-q7","number":7,"question":"<p>Find the velocity vector of a particle in each case, given the speed <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"v\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and direction in which the particle is travelling, leaving your answers in exact form:</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"v=10\\text{ ms}^{-1}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> parallel to <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\binom10\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"v=4\\text{ ms}^{-1}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> parallel to <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\binom11\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"v=0.3\\text{ ms}^{-1}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> parallel to <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\binom2{-3}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\binom{10}0\\text{ ms}^{-1}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\sqrt{1^2+1^2}=\\sqrt2\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"4\\times\\frac1{\\sqrt2}\\binom11=\\frac1{\\sqrt2}\\binom44\\text{ ms}^{-1}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">c)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\sqrt{2^2+3^2}=\\sqrt{13}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"0.3\\times\\frac1{\\sqrt{13}}\\binom2{-3}=\\frac{3\\sqrt{13}}{130}\\binom2{-3}\\text{ ms}^{-1}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>"]},{"id":"smq-year2-2.57-q8","number":8,"question":"<p>The position vector, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf r\" data-display=\"false\"></span> metres, of an object at time <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"t\" data-display=\"false\"></span> seconds is given by</p><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\mathbf r=t^2\\mathbf i+(3-2t)\\mathbf j\" data-display=\"true\"></span><p>Find its displacement between <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"t=2\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"t=5\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","steps":["<p>At <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"t=2,\\mathbf r=2^2\\mathbf i+(3-2\\times2)\\mathbf j=4\\mathbf i-\\mathbf j\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p>At <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"t=5,\\mathbf r=5^2\\mathbf i+(3-2\\times5)\\mathbf j=25\\mathbf i-7\\mathbf j\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(25\\mathbf i-7\\mathbf j)-(4\\mathbf i-\\mathbf j)=21\\mathbf i-6\\mathbf j\" data-display=\"false\"></span> metres</p>"]},{"id":"smq-year2-2.57-q9","number":9,"question":"<p>An object is initially at the origin moving with velocity <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(2\\mathbf i+5\\mathbf j)\\text{ ms}^{-1}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. It has a constant acceleration of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(6\\mathbf i-\\mathbf j)\\text{ ms}^{-2}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Find</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p>the position vector of the object at time <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"t\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p>the distance it is from the origin after 10 seconds.</p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf u=(2\\mathbf i+5\\mathbf j),\\mathbf a=(6\\mathbf i-\\mathbf j)\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf s=\\mathbf ut+\\frac12\\mathbf at^2\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf s=(2\\mathbf i-5\\mathbf j)t+\\frac12(6\\mathbf i-\\mathbf j)t^2\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"=(2t+3t^2)\\mathbf i+\\left(5t-\\frac12t^2\\right)\\mathbf j\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf s=(2\\times10+3\\times10^2)\\mathbf i+\\left(5\\times10-\\frac12\\times10^2\\right)\\mathbf j\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"=320\\mathbf i+0\\mathbf j\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p>320 metres</p>"]},{"id":"smq-year2-2.57-q10","number":10,"question":"<p>A particle <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"P\" data-display=\"false\"></span> moves with constant acceleration <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(5\\mathbf i+4\\mathbf j)\\text{ ms}^{-2}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, having been initially at rest at initial position <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(2\\mathbf i-7\\mathbf j)\" data-display=\"false\"></span> metres.</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p>Show that the expression for the position vector of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"P\" data-display=\"false\"></span> at time <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"t\" data-display=\"false\"></span> seconds is given by</p><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\mathbf r=\\left(2+\\frac52t^2\\right)\\mathbf i+(2t^2-7)\\mathbf j\" data-display=\"true\"></span></li><li><p>Hence, find the distance the particle is from the origin after 2 seconds, giving your answer to 3 significant figures.</p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf a=5\\mathbf i+4\\mathbf j,\\mathbf u=0\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf s=(2\\mathbf i-7\\mathbf j)+\\mathbf ut+\\frac12\\mathbf at^2\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf s=(2\\mathbf i-7\\mathbf j)+\\frac12(5\\mathbf i+4\\mathbf j)t^2\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf s=\\left(2+\\frac52t^2\\right)\\mathbf i+(2t^2-7)\\mathbf j\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf r=12\\mathbf i+\\mathbf j\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\sqrt{12^2+1^2}=\\sqrt{145}=12.0\" data-display=\"false\"></span> metres (3 SF)</p>"]},{"id":"smq-year2-2.57-q11","number":11,"question":"<p>Initially a particle position is <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(6\\mathbf i+2\\mathbf j)\" data-display=\"false\"></span> m relative to a fixed origin <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"O\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and is moving with velocity <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(\\mathbf i-3\\mathbf j)\\text{ ms}^{-1}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and constant acceleration <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(8\\mathbf i-5\\mathbf j)\\text{ ms}^{-2}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p><p>Find the position vector of the particle at <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"t=4\" data-display=\"false\"></span> seconds.</p>","steps":["<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf u=\\mathbf i-3\\mathbf j,\\mathbf a=8\\mathbf i-5\\mathbf j,t=4\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf s=\\mathbf ut+\\frac12\\mathbf at^2\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p>From initial position:</p>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf s=(\\mathbf i-3\\mathbf j)\\times4+\\frac12(8\\mathbf i-5\\mathbf j)\\times4^2=68\\mathbf i-52\\mathbf j\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf s_0=(6\\mathbf i+2\\mathbf j)\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p>So <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"6\\mathbf i+2\\mathbf j+68\\mathbf i-52\\mathbf j=74\\mathbf i-50\\mathbf j\" data-display=\"false\"></span> metres</p>"]},{"id":"smq-year2-2.57-q12","number":12,"question":"<p>A particle moves with constant acceleration <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\binom2{-1}\\text{ ms}^{-2}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and passes through the point <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A\" data-display=\"false\"></span> with velocity <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\binom{-1}3\\text{ ms}^{-1}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p><p>It then reaches point <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"B\" data-display=\"false\"></span> 4 seconds after leaving <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, where point <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"B\" data-display=\"false\"></span> has position vector <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\binom8{-2}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> metres relative to the origin.</p><p>Find the position vector of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","steps":["<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf u=\\binom{-1}3,\\mathbf a=\\binom2{-1},t=4\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf s=\\mathbf ut+\\frac12\\mathbf at^2\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p>From initial position:</p>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf s=\\binom{-1}3\\times4+\\frac12\\binom2{-1}\\times4^2=\\binom{12}4\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf s_A+\\binom{12}4=\\binom8{-2}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf s_A=\\binom{-4}{-6}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> metres</p>"]},{"id":"smq-year2-2.57-q13","number":13,"question":"<p>A particle moves with constant acceleration <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(2\\mathbf i-4\\mathbf j)\\text{ ms}^{-2}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. At <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"t=0\" data-display=\"false\"></span> it passes through the origin and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"T\" data-display=\"false\"></span> seconds later it passes through a point with position vector <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(-12\\mathbf i+k\\mathbf j)\" data-display=\"false\"></span> metres at velocity <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(4\\mathbf i+3\\mathbf j)\\text{ ms}^{-1}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Find</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p>the value of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"T\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p>the value of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf a=(2\\mathbf i-4\\mathbf j),\\mathbf v=(4\\mathbf i+3\\mathbf j),t=T,\\mathbf s=(4\\mathbf i+3\\mathbf j)\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf s=\\mathbf vt-\\frac12\\mathbf at^2\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(4\\mathbf i+3\\mathbf j)=(4\\mathbf i+3\\mathbf j)T-\\frac12(2\\mathbf i-4\\mathbf j)T^2\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"-12=4T-T^2\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p>Solving <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"T^2-4T-12=0\" data-display=\"false\"></span> gives <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"T=6\" data-display=\"false\"></span> or <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"T=-2\" data-display=\"false\"></span> so <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"T=6\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k=3\\times6-\\frac12\\times-4\\times6^2=90\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>"]},{"id":"smq-year2-2.57-q14","number":14,"question":"<p>A particle <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"P\" data-display=\"false\"></span> moves in a straight line from position <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\binom5{-2}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> metres to <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\binom k{78}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> metres, moving parallel to the vector <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\binom7{10}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Find the value of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","steps":["<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\binom k{78}-\\binom5{-2}=\\binom{k-5}{80}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\frac{80}{k-5}=\\frac{10}7\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"560=10(k-5)\\Rightarrow k=61\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>"]},{"id":"smq-year2-2.57-q15","number":15,"question":"<p>For each of the following, the two vectors represent the velocity of two particles which are moving with constant velocity and parallel to each other. In each case, find the value of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k\" data-display=\"false\"></span> for this to hold:</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(2\\mathbf i-4\\mathbf j)\\text{ ms}^{-1}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(4\\mathbf i-k\\mathbf j)\\text{ ms}^{-1}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(5\\mathbf i+3\\mathbf j)\\text{ ms}^{-1}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(-10\\mathbf i+k\\mathbf j)\\text{ ms}^{-1}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(-3\\mathbf i+10\\mathbf j)\\text{ ms}^{-1}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(k\\mathbf i+30\\mathbf j)\\text{ ms}^{-1}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(1.5\\mathbf i-9\\mathbf j)\\text{ ms}^{-1}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k(2\\mathbf i-12\\mathbf j)\\text{ ms}^{-1}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k=8\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k=-6\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">c)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k=-9\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">d)</h3><p>Any value of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>"]},{"id":"smq-year2-2.57-q16","number":16,"question":"<p>A particle passes through the origin at <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"t=0\" data-display=\"false\"></span> with velocity <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\binom92\\text{ ms}^{-1}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and constant acceleration <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\binom23\\text{ ms}^{-2}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. At <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"t=T\" data-display=\"false\"></span> the particle is moving in the direction of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\binom41\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p><p>Find the value of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"T\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","steps":["<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf a=\\binom23,\\mathbf u=\\binom92,t=T\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf v=\\mathbf u+\\mathbf at\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf v=\\binom92+\\binom23T=\\binom{9+2T}{2+3T}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\binom{9+2T}{2+3T}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> is parallel to <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\binom41\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\frac{2+3T}{9+2T}=\\frac14\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow4(2+3T)=9+2T\\Rightarrow8+12T=9+2T\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow10T=1\\Rightarrow T=\\frac1{10}=0.1\" data-display=\"false\"></span> seconds</p>"]},{"id":"smq-year2-2.57-q17","number":17,"question":"<p>Emily is cycling with constant velocity <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(4.2\\mathbf i+14.4\\mathbf j)\\text{ ms}^{-1}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> along a straight road. Henry is cycling parallel to Emily, on the same path.</p><p>Find the velocity for Henry in each of the following scenarios:</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p>Henry is cycling twice as fast as Emily in the same direction.</p></li><li><p>Henry is cycling with speed <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"5\\text{ ms}^{-1}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> in the same direction.</p></li><li><p>Henry is cycling with speed <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"12\\text{ ms}^{-1}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> in the same direction.</p></li><li><p>Henry is cycling with speed <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"7.5\\text{ ms}^{-1}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> in the opposite direction.</p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"2(4.2\\mathbf i+14.4\\mathbf j)=8.4\\mathbf i+28.8\\mathbf j\\text{ ms}^{-1}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><p>Emily's speed: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\sqrt{4.2^2+14.4^2}=15\\text{ ms}^{-1}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\frac13(4.2\\mathbf i+14.4\\mathbf j)=1.4\\mathbf i+4.8\\mathbf j\\text{ ms}^{-1}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">c)</h3><p>Emily's speed: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\sqrt{4.2^2+14.4^2}=15\\text{ ms}^{-1}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\frac45(4.2\\mathbf i+14.4\\mathbf j)=3.36\\mathbf i+11.52\\mathbf j\\text{ ms}^{-1}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">d)</h3><p>Emily's speed: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\sqrt{4.2^2+14.4^2}=15\\text{ ms}^{-1}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"-\\frac12(4.2\\mathbf i+14.4\\mathbf j)=-2.1\\mathbf i-7.2\\mathbf j\\text{ ms}^{-1}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>"]},{"id":"smq-year2-2.57-q18","number":18,"question":"<p>Two particles <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"B\" data-display=\"false\"></span> are moving parallel to each other. Particle <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A\" data-display=\"false\"></span> is moving with constant velocity <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\binom9{21.6}\\text{ ms}^{-1}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Particle <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"B\" data-display=\"false\"></span> begins at a position of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\binom2{-3}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> m relative to a fixed origin and moves with constant speed <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"19.5\\text{ ms}^{-1}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p><p>Find</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p>the speed of Particle <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p></li><li><p>the velocity of Particle <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"B\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p></li><li><p>the position vector of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"B\" data-display=\"false\"></span> after 5 seconds.</p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\sqrt{9^2+21.6^2}=23.4\\text{ ms}^{-1}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><p>Particle <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"B\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"13\\times\\frac1{23.4}\\binom9{21.6}=\\binom{7.5}{18}\\text{ ms}^{-1}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">c)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\binom2{-3}+5\\binom{7.5}{18}=\\binom{39.5}{87}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> metres</p>"]},{"id":"smq-year2-2.57-q19","number":19,"question":"<p>Two particles <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"B\" data-display=\"false\"></span> are moving parallel to each other, starting 4 metres apart and then at a fixed time later, are 4 metres apart again. Particle <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A\" data-display=\"false\"></span> travels a distance of 16 metres and particle <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"B\" data-display=\"false\"></span> travels a distance of 20 metres.</p><p>Find the shortest distance between their two lines of motion, giving your answer to 3 significant figures.</p>","steps":["<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\sqrt{4^2-\\left(\\frac{20-16}2\\right)^2}=2\\sqrt3=3.46\" data-display=\"false\"></span> metres (3 SF)</p>"]},{"id":"smq-year2-2.57-q20","number":20,"question":"<p>Two squirrels are running along parallel branches of trees in the woods. At time <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"t=0\" data-display=\"false\"></span> seconds, the first squirrel starts at position <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(-\\mathbf i+3\\mathbf j)\" data-display=\"false\"></span> metres and is moving with constant speed of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"5.2\\text{ ms}^{-1}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. The second squirrel runs with constant velocity <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(2.4\\mathbf i+5.76\\mathbf j)\\text{ ms}^{-1}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p><p>By modelling the branches as flat straight paths, find</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p>the speed of the second squirrel.</p></li><li><p>the position vector of the first squirrel when 2.5 seconds have passed.</p></li></ol><p>Given that the second squirrel starts at position <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(11\\mathbf i-2\\mathbf j)\" data-display=\"false\"></span> metres,</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"3\"><li><p>determine the shortest distance between their two branches.</p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\sqrt{2.4^2+5.76^2}=6.24\\text{ ms}^{-1}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf v=5.2\\times\\frac1{6.24}(2.4\\mathbf i+5.76\\mathbf j)=2\\mathbf i+4.8\\mathbf j\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf s=(-\\mathbf i+3\\mathbf j)+2.5(2\\mathbf i+4.8\\mathbf j)\" data-display=\"false\"></span> metres</p>","<p>So <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(4\\mathbf i+15\\mathbf j)\" data-display=\"false\"></span> metres</p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">c)</h3><p>Vector from where the first squirrel starts to where it is after 2.5 seconds is <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"5\\mathbf i+12\\mathbf j\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p>Vector from where the first squirrel starts to where the second squirrel starts is <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"12\\mathbf i-5\\mathbf j\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p>These vectors are perpendicular. As the second squirrel is travelling faster than the first squirrel, they will never be closer than they are initially.</p>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\therefore\\sqrt{12^2+(-5)^2}=13\" data-display=\"false\"></span> metres</p>"]},{"id":"smq-year2-2.57-q21","number":21,"question":"<p>Particle <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A\" data-display=\"false\"></span> starts with position vector <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\binom{-7}{-1}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> m and constant velocity <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\binom63\\text{ ms}^{-1}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Particle <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"B\" data-display=\"false\"></span> starts with position vector <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\binom02\" data-display=\"false\"></span> m and constant velocity <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\binom{2.5}{1.5}\\text{ ms}^{-1}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p><p>Show that the particles collide.</p>","steps":["<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\binom{-7}{-1}+t\\binom63=\\binom02+t\\binom{2.5}{1.5}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"-7+6t=2.5t\\Rightarrow t=2\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"-1+3t=2+1.5t\\Rightarrow t=2\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p>Same position at <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"t=2\" data-display=\"false\"></span> <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\therefore\" data-display=\"false\"></span> they collide.</p>"]},{"id":"smq-year2-2.57-q22","number":22,"question":"<p>Particles <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"B\" data-display=\"false\"></span> are both moving in straight lines. Particle <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A\" data-display=\"false\"></span> has a constant velocity of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\binom{3.5}{12}\\text{ ms}^{-1}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and Particle <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"B\" data-display=\"false\"></span> moves with a speed of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"6.25\\text{ ms}^{-1}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p><p>Both particle <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and particle <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"B\" data-display=\"false\"></span> pass through point <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"P\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Particle <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"B\" data-display=\"false\"></span> reaches point <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"P\" data-display=\"false\"></span> first, with particle <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A\" data-display=\"false\"></span> passing through it 2 seconds later. Given that the two lines of motion are perpendicular to each other, find the distance between particle <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and particle <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"B\" data-display=\"false\"></span> 6 seconds after particle <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"B\" data-display=\"false\"></span> passed through point <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"P\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","steps":["<p>Particle <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A\" data-display=\"false\"></span> has speed <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\sqrt{3.5^2+12^2}=12.5\\text{ ms}^{-1}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"4\\times12.5=50\" data-display=\"false\"></span> metres</p>","<p>Particle <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"B\" data-display=\"false\"></span> has speed <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"6.25\\text{ ms}^{-1}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"6\\times6.25=37.5\" data-display=\"false\"></span> metres</p>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\sqrt{50^2+37.5^2}=62.5\" data-display=\"false\"></span> m</p>"]},{"id":"smq-year2-2.57-q23","number":23,"question":"<p><strong>The following questions that use <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf i\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf j\" data-display=\"false\"></span> are unit vectors pointing east and north respectively.</strong> For each of the following velocity vectors, state the direction that the particle is moving in:</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(2\\mathbf i)\\text{ ms}^{-1}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(-5\\mathbf j)\\text{ ms}^{-1}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(4\\mathbf i+4\\mathbf j)\\text{ ms}^{-1}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(-5\\mathbf i+5\\mathbf j)\\text{ ms}^{-1}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><p>East</p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><p>South</p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">c)</h3><p>North-East</p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">d)</h3><p>North-West</p>"]},{"id":"smq-year2-2.57-q24","number":24,"question":"<p>A ship, moving with constant acceleration, is travelling due east at a speed of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"4\\text{ ms}^{-1}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p><p>After 40 seconds it is travelling due south at <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"2\\text{ ms}^{-1}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Find</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p>the displacement from its initial position after 40 seconds.</p></li><li><p>the distance the ship has travelled from its initial position after 40 seconds.</p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf u=\\binom40,\\mathbf v=\\binom0{-2},t=40\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf s=\\frac12(\\mathbf u+\\mathbf v)t\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf s=\\frac12\\binom4{-2}\\times40=\\binom{80}{-40}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> m</p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\sqrt{80^2+(-40)^2}=40\\sqrt5=89.4\" data-display=\"false\"></span> m (3 SF)</p>"]},{"id":"smq-year2-2.57-q25","number":25,"question":"<p>The velocity, in <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\text{ ms}^{-1}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, of an object at time <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"t\" data-display=\"false\"></span> seconds is given by</p><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\mathbf v=(t-5)\\mathbf i+(2t-13)\\mathbf j\" data-display=\"true\"></span><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p>Show the object is never instantaneously at rest.</p></li><li><p>Find the time at which the object is moving directly to the south.</p></li><li><p>Find the time at which the object is moving to the north-east.</p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"t-5=0\\Rightarrow t=5\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"2t-9=0\\Rightarrow t=\\frac{13}2\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p>Not the same times, therefore, is never at rest.</p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"t-5=0\\Rightarrow t=5\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf v=-3\\mathbf j\" data-display=\"false\"></span> which is due south so <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"t=5\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">c)</h3><p>Equal positive components:</p>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"t-5=2t-13\\Rightarrow t=8\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>"]},{"id":"smq-year2-2.57-q26","number":26,"question":"<p>An object moves so that its position vector, in metres, relative to the origin <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"O\" data-display=\"false\"></span> at time <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"t\" data-display=\"false\"></span> seconds is given by</p><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\mathbf r=(105+8t)\\mathbf i+t^2\\mathbf j\" data-display=\"true\"></span><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p>Determine the time at which the object is east of the origin.</p></li><li><p>Determine the time at which the object is north-east of the origin.</p></li><li><p>Explain why the object never moves in the westwards direction.</p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"t^2=0\" data-display=\"false\"></span> so at <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"t=0\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"105+8t=t^2\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p>Solving <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"t^2-8t-105\" data-display=\"false\"></span> gives <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"t=15\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"t=-7\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p>So at <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"t=15\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">c)</h3><p>Since <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"t\\ge0\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"105+8t\\ge105\" data-display=\"false\"></span> so cannot move West</p>"]},{"id":"smq-year2-2.57-q27","number":27,"question":"<p>A particle passes point <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A\" data-display=\"false\"></span> with velocity <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\binom38\\text{ ms}^{-1}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and has acceleration <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\binom2{-20}\\text{ ms}^{-2}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p><p>At the instant it reaches point <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"B\" data-display=\"false\"></span> it is travelling in a due east direction.</p><p>Find the time at which it reaches point <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"B\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","steps":["<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf u=\\binom38,\\mathbf a=\\binom2{-20}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf v=\\mathbf u+\\mathbf at\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf v=\\binom38+\\binom2{-20}t=\\binom{3+2t}{8-20t}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"8-20t=0\" data-display=\"false\"></span> so <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"t=0.4\" data-display=\"false\"></span> seconds</p>"]},{"id":"smq-year2-2.57-q28","number":28,"question":"<p>A particle passes point <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A\" data-display=\"false\"></span> with velocity <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\binom13\\text{ ms}^{-1}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and has acceleration <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\binom{15}5\\text{ ms}^{-2}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p><p>At the instant it reaches point <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"B\" data-display=\"false\"></span> it is travelling in a due north-east direction.</p><p>Find the time at which it reaches point <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"B\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","steps":["<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf u=\\binom13,\\mathbf a=\\binom{15}5\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf v=\\mathbf u+\\mathbf at\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf v=\\binom13+\\binom{15}5t=\\binom{1+15t}{3+5t}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"1+15t=3+5t\\Rightarrow10t=2\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p>so <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"t=0.2\" data-display=\"false\"></span> seconds</p>"]},{"id":"smq-year2-2.57-q29","number":29,"question":"<p>A particle is travelling with constant acceleration. It passes point <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A\" data-display=\"false\"></span> with velocity <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\binom6{-12}\\text{ ms}^{-1}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and then passes point <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"B\" data-display=\"false\"></span> with velocity <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\binom{-2}2\\text{ ms}^{-1}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p><p>Find</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p>the acceleration of the particle when <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"t=2\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p>the time at which it is travelling due south.</p></li><li><p>the speed at which it is travelling at the exact point it is travelling due south.</p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf u=\\binom6{-12},\\mathbf v=\\binom{-2}2\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf v=\\mathbf u+\\mathbf at\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\binom{-2}2=\\binom6{-12}+2\\mathbf a\\Rightarrow\\mathbf a=\\binom{-4}7\\text{ ms}^{-1}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf v=\\mathbf u+\\mathbf at\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf v=\\binom6{-12}+\\binom{-4}7t=\\binom{6-4t}{-12+7t}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p>Due south:</p>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"6-4t=0\" data-display=\"false\"></span> so at <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"t=1.5\" data-display=\"false\"></span> seconds</p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">c)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\binom{6-4\\times1.5}{-12+7\\times1.5}=\\binom0{-1.5}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> so <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"1.5\\text{ ms}^{-1}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> due south</p>"]},{"id":"smq-year2-2.57-q30","number":30,"question":"<p>A particle is travelling with constant acceleration <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(-\\mathbf i-3\\mathbf j)\\text{ ms}^{-2}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and passes the origin with velocity <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(13\\mathbf i-5\\mathbf j)\\text{ ms}^{-1}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. After a further 5 seconds have passed, the particle reaches point <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"P\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Find</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p>the speed the particle is travelling in when it passes through point <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"P\" data-display=\"false\"></span> giving your answer to 3 significant figures.</p></li><li><p>Find the bearing at which the particle is travelling when it passes through point <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"P\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf a=-\\mathbf i-3\\mathbf j,\\mathbf u=13\\mathbf i-5\\mathbf j,t=5\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf v=\\mathbf u+\\mathbf at\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf v=(13\\mathbf i-5\\mathbf j)+5(-\\mathbf i-3\\mathbf j)=8\\mathbf i-20\\mathbf j\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\sqrt{8^2+20^2}=4\\sqrt{29}=21.5\\text{ ms}^{-1}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> (3 SF)</p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\arctan\\left(\\frac{20}8\\right)=68.19859\\ldots\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"90+68.19859\\ldots\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p>Bearing of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"158^\\circ\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>"]},{"id":"smq-year2-2.57-q31","number":31,"question":"<p>A helicopter is initially hovering above a field. It then sets off so that its acceleration is <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(0.4\\mathbf i+0.2\\mathbf j)\\text{ ms}^{-2}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p><p>The helicopter does not change its height as it moves.</p><p>Find</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p>the speed of the helicopter 15 seconds after it leaves its position above the field.</p></li><li><p>the bearing on which the helicopter is travelling, 15 seconds after it leaves its position above the field, giving your answer correct to the nearest degree.</p></li></ol><p>The helicopter stops accelerating when it is 240 metres from its initial position.</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"3\"><li><p>Find the time that it takes for the helicopter to travel from its initial position to the point where it stops accelerating.</p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf a=0.4\\mathbf i+0.2\\mathbf j,\\mathbf u=0,t=20\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf v=\\mathbf u+\\mathbf at\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf v=\\mathbf0+15(0.4\\mathbf i+0.2\\mathbf j)=6\\mathbf i+3\\mathbf j\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\sqrt{6^2+3^2}=3\\sqrt5=6.71\\text{ ms}^{-1}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> (3 SF)</p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\arctan\\left(\\frac36\\right)=26.56505118\\ldots\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"90-26.56505\\ldots=63.43494882\\ldots\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p>Bearing of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"063^\\circ\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">c)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf s=\\mathbf ut+\\frac12\\mathbf at^2\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf s=\\mathbf0+\\frac12(0.4\\mathbf i+0.2\\mathbf j)t^2=(0.2t^2)\\mathbf i+(0.1t^2)\\mathbf j\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"240=\\sqrt{(0.2t^2)^2+(0.1t^2)^2}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"57600=0.04t^4+0.01t^4\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"57600=0.05t^4\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"t=32.8\" data-display=\"false\"></span> seconds (3 SF)</p>"]}]